            "quote": "<p>\"I went to school for skin care and I did not believe it was even possible to see results that quickly...\"</p>",
            "description": "Normally I would never post a pic without makeup on, because get embarrassed about my hyperpigmentation, but I had to share. I’m so happy I decided that give this stuff a try! I’ve only been using it for about 5 days and my pimples are basically gone and my hyperpigmentation is noticeably fading already! I went to school for skin care and I did not believe it was even possible to see results that quickly until I tried this. Seriously, just try it!",
